{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o036b","title":"刘备拒绝会所袭刘璋之议","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o036b-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"张松使法正进言，庞统亦建议在会所袭刘璋；刘备以不可仓促而未从。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o036b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0045","role":"授意","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o036b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0046","role":"进言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o036b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0048","role":"献策","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o036b-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"未从","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o036b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"涪","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o036b-q"]},"time":{"year":211,"label":"涪会时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y211","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o034","basis":"涪会时"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o036b-q","xianzhu-q-o034","xianzhu-q-b-09400c250015597cdc75"]},"source_order":[32,162,"O036b"],"order":6556}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0045","name":"张松","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0046","name":"法正","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0048","name":"庞统","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o036b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-0e5a4f9cc0d9229b2789","layer":"original","quote":"张松令法正白先主，及谋臣庞统进说〖1〗：便可于会所袭璋〖2〗。先主曰：“此大事也，不可仓猝！”","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":37,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-09400c250015597cdc75","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-09400c250015597cdc75","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211 ）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8471d798647e2ff3307a","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o034","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-464a6d3ab5db13314b70","layer":"original","quote":"十六年〖10〗，益州牧刘璋，遥闻曹公将遣钟繇等向汉中讨张鲁，内怀恐惧。别驾从事蜀郡张松说璋曰：“曹公兵强，无敌于天下；若因张鲁之资以取蜀土〖11〗，谁能御之者乎？”璋曰：“吾固忧之而未有计。”松曰：“刘豫州，使君之宗室，而曹公之深仇也，善用兵；若使之讨鲁，鲁必破；鲁破，则益州强；曹公虽来，无能为也。”","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":140,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
